                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-10-28"><hi rendition="#italic">October 28,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger asks if indemnity for Chinese Christians shall be demanded, and
                    states that such demand is strongly opposed by the Russian minister.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
